WEBVTT

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:53.130
Previous April 4th

00:02:05.810 --> 00:02:08.770
Kamizono Academy

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:31.630
The Same Day
Nonomura Residence

00:02:42.770 --> 00:02:44.140
It's raining.

00:02:50.820 --> 00:02:53.520
It starts today, huh?

00:02:58.990 --> 00:03:01.910
Kazamatsuri Residence

00:03:04.630 --> 00:03:06.520
Huh?  It's only 6 o'clock...

00:03:15.720 --> 00:03:17.700
Whatever...

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:22.910
I wonder if she'll be there.

00:03:23.990 --> 00:03:27.230
Well, whatever...

00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:30.730
Kageyama Residence

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:35.440
Huh?  You're going today?

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:41.700
Well, I guess that's right.  You <i>are</i> the student council president, after all.

00:03:41.980 --> 00:03:43.640
What about Torako?

00:03:43.640 --> 00:03:45.140
Beats me.

00:03:45.140 --> 00:03:47.760
Does she realize what day it is today?

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:50.060
She probably forgot.

00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:54.750
No chance, huh?

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:04.680
In some prefecture, at some place

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:47.510
This weather sucks.

00:04:59.540 --> 00:05:01.690
Iizuka Residence

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:18.540
Tsubomiya Residence

00:05:24.060 --> 00:05:26.530
Why don't I change your hairstyle?

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:31.260
Maybe next time.

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:35.510
Sis, I hope you make a lot of friends.

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:43.150
Good luck...

00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:46.110
Kobayashi House

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:53.240
Yes yes, I know... I'm keeping them in control the best I can.

00:05:54.170 --> 00:05:58.930
No no, just take your time coming to the entrance ceremony, please.

00:06:02.760 --> 00:06:06.570
Hey, when it's time to eat, eat!  Turn off the TV.

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:09.630
Here, mornin' grub.

00:06:21.590 --> 00:06:23.570
You're so cute, Suzu.

00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:28.390
I'm sure glad we bought them back at your place yesterday.

00:06:28.390 --> 00:06:31.990
Anyway you slice it, there ain't no stores around here.

00:06:45.520 --> 00:06:48.380
So how many days has it been since I ran away from home?

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:51.380
Four days?

00:06:56.710 --> 00:06:58.490
And the longest ever...

00:06:58.490 --> 00:06:59.610
Eight days.

00:06:59.610 --> 00:07:00.530
And the next?

00:07:00.530 --> 00:07:02.240
Five days.

00:07:02.240 --> 00:07:04.880
Third worst in history.

00:07:04.880 --> 00:07:06.390
Not to mention...

00:07:06.390 --> 00:07:09.040
It's been three days since we've taken a bath.

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:09.860
Yeah...

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:12.610
Do I smell?

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:14.610
I smell, don't I?

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:17.830
I haven't even married yet...

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:20.260
And funds are running dangerously low.

00:07:20.260 --> 00:07:21.950
How much more we got, Suzu?

00:07:21.950 --> 00:07:23.930
1270 yen.

00:07:23.930 --> 00:07:27.100
When we run out, we'll seriously have to hitchhike.

00:07:28.250 --> 00:07:31.310
Guess that's as far as we go this time.

00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:33.430
No choice but to go home.

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:37.110
I don't wanna go home...

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:49.610
Oba House

00:08:09.830 --> 00:08:12.130
It looks excellent on you...

00:08:12.920 --> 00:08:14.980
Ojou-sama.

00:08:16.730 --> 00:08:17.970
Thank you.

00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:24.040
I guess this is goodbye to this middle school uniform.

00:08:24.040 --> 00:08:26.640
I think I preferred the ribbon.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:32.070
Where is Father?

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:36.110
Oh, right... It seems like he cannot return today after all.

00:08:36.110 --> 00:08:40.370
I cannot believe that the master will not be able to come even on such an important day...

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:42.130
It is fine, I do not mind.

00:08:42.130 --> 00:08:45.290
It is merely advancing a year within the same school, after all.

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:48.920
And mother will be there, so that is enough for me.

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:55.110
Ojou-sama, a picture!

00:08:55.110 --> 00:08:56.330
We must take your picture, yes!

00:08:56.330 --> 00:08:58.560
But, you took so many the other day!

00:08:58.560 --> 00:09:02.180
And anyway, I must leave now or I will be late!

00:09:03.070 --> 00:09:07.650
The rain is lifting.  Isn't that nice?

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:09.280
Um...

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:17.820
Makunouchi Residence

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:19.780
Makunouchi Liquor Store

00:09:23.880 --> 00:09:25.830
Hey!  Stand up straight!

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:28.120
I ain't a kid no more.

00:09:28.120 --> 00:09:30.670
It'll just take a second.  Stand up straight.

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:31.600
Put the bag down to the side.

00:09:31.600 --> 00:09:34.040
Isn't doing this through middle school enough?

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:35.510
It's for the memories.

00:09:37.520 --> 00:09:38.960
Ready?

00:09:39.380 --> 00:09:40.930
Smile.

00:09:45.420 --> 00:09:47.720
Hey, Ushio!

00:09:47.720 --> 00:09:49.640
Take care of yourself!

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:55.320
Beautiful girl with no makeup...

00:09:56.990 --> 00:09:58.040
What?

00:09:58.040 --> 00:09:59.160
Nothing.

00:10:00.150 --> 00:10:02.260
How long are you gonna be eatin' that?

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:07.500
Whatever.  Take as long as you want...

00:10:16.900 --> 00:10:20.030
It's not like there's some reason to hurry home.

00:10:26.970 --> 00:10:30.940
Heisei 20 Kamizono Academy Elementary Middle High School Combined Entrance Ceremony

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:33.120
And that's that.

00:10:33.120 --> 00:10:34.690
You did a good job.

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:36.530
Youth at work.

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:39.030
Why don't you help out a bit?

00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:42.840
We're welcoming our new underclassmen!

00:10:43.130 --> 00:10:44.660
I am working!

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:51.460
Photoshop Yanagi

00:10:47.070 --> 00:10:49.620
My job is <i>this</i>.

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:07.600
Kamizono Academy!

00:11:15.800 --> 00:11:17.020
Amazing!

00:11:17.020 --> 00:11:19.570
Viva Kamizono!

00:11:26.600 --> 00:11:29.160
The upperclassmen, too!

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:34.330
I'm so glad I got in here.

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:46.760
Kamizono Academy Entrance Ceremony
Program

00:11:41.520 --> 00:11:43.170
1.  Opening Words

00:11:43.170 --> 00:11:44.960
2.  Reading of new student's names

00:11:44.960 --> 00:11:47.650
3.  Declaration of acceptance

00:11:47.650 --> 00:11:49.120
4.  Speech from President of Academy

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:50.810
5.  Guest Speaker

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:55.420
6.  Representative from the incoming class gets congratulatory telegram leads oath...

00:11:55.420 --> 00:11:59.790
Amagasa-sensei, you needn't be so nervous.

00:11:59.790 --> 00:12:03.180
So why am I presiding over the ceremony?

00:12:03.180 --> 00:12:07.240
I'm responsible for a class of first years, and I'll be introduced as such as well...

00:12:07.240 --> 00:12:08.840
So, why?

00:12:08.840 --> 00:12:11.270
Oh, that's probably because of that.

00:12:11.270 --> 00:12:13.580
What?  Does something come to mind?

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:15.920
Random lottery.

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:20.170
Yes.

00:12:21.020 --> 00:12:22.510
You've got to be kidding me!

00:12:34.510 --> 00:12:39.370
Which-One-Should-I-Choose?

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:51.130
Isn't that strange?

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:57.190
I'm sorry, it's just been so long since I've driven my own car.

00:12:57.190 --> 00:13:01.540
Do not worry, Mother.  It will not matter if we are a little late.

00:13:01.540 --> 00:13:02.840
Are you sure?

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:05.480
That's odd.

00:13:07.810 --> 00:13:10.970
I can imagine where this is going...

00:13:19.920 --> 00:13:23.480
Mom!  Help me with my necktie!

00:13:28.710 --> 00:13:31.160
Class 6, huh?

00:13:34.560 --> 00:13:37.280
I'm in class 6 too.  Nice to meetcha!

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:41.400
Hey, hey, hey, hey!  Let's take a commemorative picture!

00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:43.730
Say, "Blue Cheese!"

00:13:45.040 --> 00:13:47.470
Blue cheese?

00:13:53.800 --> 00:13:56.430
Say, what's that room?

00:14:00.920 --> 00:14:05.260
I'm Nonomura Ayumi.  Nice to meet you.

00:14:11.780 --> 00:14:15.740
It's no use... I don't have the confidence.

00:14:16.100 --> 00:14:20.460
What's the matter?  I'm just like I was at the beginning of middle school.

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:23.920
If I'm not able to make a single friend...

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:29.390
No, that's no good.

00:14:29.390 --> 00:14:32.890
I'm in high school already, I have to be strong!

00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:35.950
Be...

00:14:37.870 --> 00:14:40.940
I know what I'm doing is wrong, I know it.

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:43.980
I'm just being childish and throwing a tantrum.

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:49.180
I don't really hate my brother or sister really.

00:14:49.180 --> 00:14:52.350
I think they realize it too.

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:58.900
Actually, I kind of hate my brother.

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:03.530
I hate my dad more, though.

00:15:03.530 --> 00:15:08.200
I'm sorry, I'm always blabbing on about the same things.

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:11.650
Don't worry about it.

00:15:16.990 --> 00:15:20.180
I'd give up my virginity if it were you, Suzu.

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:24.660
I'd give you my first kiss.

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:31.320
You crazy idiot!  Don't do it for real!

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:34.250
My first kiss!  What have you done?!

00:15:51.210 --> 00:15:53.930
She's cute!

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:02.880
Things are going to be fun.

00:16:04.890 --> 00:16:06.130
What?

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:07.650
Whoa, she's scary!

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:09.480
Okay!

00:16:09.480 --> 00:16:13.420
Everyone's sitting at the seat with their name on it, right?

00:16:13.420 --> 00:16:16.370
I'm the teacher in charge of this class:

00:16:23.270 --> 00:16:24.830
Amagasa Kyouichiro!

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:27.090
We're going to the entrance ceremony now.

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:29.180
Line up out in the hall.

00:16:31.060 --> 00:16:33.660
There's some people who aren't here yet.

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:34.260
Kageyama Torako

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:39.260
Iizuka, Saotome, and Kageyama Torako.

00:16:41.930 --> 00:16:44.980
Okay then, hurry and line up in the hall, orderly now!

00:17:12.290 --> 00:17:13.170
Suzu!

00:17:18.490 --> 00:17:19.800
Let's go to school!

00:17:20.920 --> 00:17:23.720
That's right, we're in high school now.

00:17:23.720 --> 00:17:30.630
We'll make new friends, do new things, and work towards graduating from childish things like running away from home.

00:17:30.630 --> 00:17:33.660
Wait, when was the entrance ceremony again?

00:17:33.660 --> 00:17:35.720
April 4th.

00:17:41.850 --> 00:17:43.200
That's today?!

00:17:45.300 --> 00:17:54.880
We now will begin the Kamizono Academy Elementary Middle High School Combined Entrance Ceremony!

00:17:54.880 --> 00:17:57.570
Shit, we have to get back!

00:17:57.570 --> 00:17:59.200
Where the hell are we anyway?

00:17:59.200 --> 00:18:00.760
It says "ikejima."

00:18:00.760 --> 00:18:03.290
Ikejima?  Where is that?

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:04.390
Are we still in the prefecture?

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:05.840
Crap...

00:18:05.840 --> 00:18:07.900
Come bus, come bus, come bus, come bus!

00:18:09.620 --> 00:18:12.360
But first I need a bath!

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:14.220
My head itches!

00:18:14.220 --> 00:18:16.320
I remember!

00:18:20.650 --> 00:18:25.410
We came this way looking for that onsen we heard about.

00:18:26.240 --> 00:18:28.460
Let's go, hurry up!

00:18:28.460 --> 00:18:29.780
To the onsen!

00:18:29.780 --> 00:18:30.580
Right.

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:31.880
And school after that!

00:18:56.160 --> 00:19:05.770
On this wonderful day, Kamizono Academy welcomes you young souls filled with so many hopes and goals.

00:19:05.770 --> 00:19:11.040
As the President of this Academy, it truly fills me with joy and happiness.

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:14.500
The overflowing talent you all possess...

00:19:41.780 --> 00:19:49.490
They say that the number of children is decreasing lately, but what am I to make of such a bevy of youth?

00:19:49.490 --> 00:19:54.210
Enough about what makes the school staff smile so, though.

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:57.460
I guess you didn't ask me, did you?

00:20:06.470 --> 00:20:17.860
Incoming students and parents, you have my sincere congratulations on your entrance to this school!

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:12.470
Stop!

00:22:02.220 --> 00:22:04.510
Hey, stop!

00:22:04.510 --> 00:22:05.500
You do it too, Suzu!

00:22:05.500 --> 00:22:07.430
Stop!

00:22:07.430 --> 00:22:09.170
Why are you ordering them?

00:22:09.170 --> 00:22:10.770
Who the hell do you think you are?

00:22:10.770 --> 00:22:12.470
Puwease stop!

00:22:12.470 --> 00:22:14.190
What the heck is that?

00:22:14.190 --> 00:22:15.570
Do it more, lady-like!

00:22:15.570 --> 00:22:16.910
Like how?

00:22:16.910 --> 00:22:19.240
Won't you please stop? *kiss*

00:22:19.240 --> 00:22:20.620
Is that okay?

00:22:20.620 --> 00:22:21.930
Try it out.

00:22:21.930 --> 00:22:23.240
Look, practice!

00:22:23.240 --> 00:22:25.600
Stop! *smooch*

00:22:25.600 --> 00:22:26.230
Like that.

00:22:26.530 --> 00:22:31.190
Please stop, young man, or old man, or whatever!

00:22:31.190 --> 00:22:32.220
Give us a ride!

00:22:32.220 --> 00:22:35.540
We'll take women and old ladies, too!

00:22:38.200 --> 00:22:40.220
They didn't stop.

00:22:40.220 --> 00:22:43.310
For goodness sake... Two pretty girls hitchhiking...

00:22:43.310 --> 00:22:46.570
Doesn't anyone romanticize about meeting people that way?

00:22:46.570 --> 00:22:48.100
Pretty girls?

00:22:48.100 --> 00:22:50.600
Two of 'em, right?

00:22:50.600 --> 00:22:52.800
Stop, damn you!

00:22:52.800 --> 00:22:54.970
Now you're ordering them yourself.

00:22:54.970 --> 00:22:57.630
Well we've got to try lots of different techniques.

00:22:57.630 --> 00:22:59.930
If temptation is no good, then threaten!

00:22:59.930 --> 00:23:02.520
If that doesn't work then try turning on the water works, etc...

00:23:02.520 --> 00:23:03.890
Suzu, do you have any ideas?

00:23:03.890 --> 00:23:04.470
Well...

00:23:04.470 --> 00:23:10.090
That's right.  It would be a little bit longer until we met.

00:23:10.090 --> 00:23:11.820
You're showing too much skin!
